# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit Code of Conduct defines and enforces the values and conduct of contributors and participants in the Qiskit open source community."
msgstr "Kode Etik Qiskit mendefinisikan dan menegakkan nilai-nilai serta perilaku kontributor dan peserta dalam komunitas open source Qiskit."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Code of conduct"
msgstr "Kode Etik"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Code of conduct {#code-of-conduct}"
msgstr "Kode Etik {#code-of-conduct}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our Pledge {#our-pledge}"
msgstr "Janji Kami {#our-pledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit Community is dedicated to our values of treating every individual\n"
"with respect and dignity. In the interest of fostering an open and welcoming\n"
"environment, all participants, including attendees, speakers, sponsors,\n"
"volunteers, online contributors, and IBM employees are expected to show\n"
"courtesy for each other and our community by creating a harassment-free\n"
"experience for everyone, regardless of age, personal appearance, disability,\n"
"ethnicity, gender identity and expression, body size, level of experience,\n"
"nationality, race, religion, caste, or sexual identity and orientation.\n"
"Expected behavior applies to both online and offline engagement within the\n"
"Qiskit Community.\n"
msgstr ""
"Komunitas Qiskit berkomitmen pada nilai-nilai kami untuk memperlakukan setiap individu\n"
"dengan hormat dan bermartabat. Demi mendorong lingkungan yang terbuka dan ramah,\n"
"semua peserta, termasuk pengunjung, pembicara, sponsor,\n"
"relawan, kontributor online, dan karyawan IBM diharapkan untuk saling\n"
"menghormati satu sama lain dan komunitas kita dengan menciptakan pengalaman bebas pelecehan\n"
"bagi semua orang, tanpa memandang usia, penampilan fisik, disabilitas,\n"
"etnisitas, identitas dan ekspresi gender, ukuran tubuh, tingkat pengalaman,\n"
"kebangsaan, ras, agama, kasta, atau identitas dan orientasi seksual.\n"
"Perilaku yang diharapkan berlaku untuk keterlibatan online maupun offline dalam\n"
"Komunitas Qiskit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scope {#scope}"
msgstr "Ruang Lingkup {#scope}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The purpose of this Code of Conduct is to define and enforce the values and\n"
"conduct of contributors and participants in the Qiskit open source community.\n"
"The Code of Conduct applies both within project spaces and in public spaces\n"
"when an individual is engaging with the Qiskit open source community. Examples\n"
"include attending a Qiskit event, contributing to online projects, commentary\n"
"on Slack, or representing a project or community, including using an official\n"
"project e-mail address, posting via an official social media account, or\n"
"acting as an appointed representative at an online or offline event.\n"
"Representation of a project may be further defined and clarified by project\n"
"maintainers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tujuan Kode Etik ini adalah untuk mendefinisikan dan menegakkan nilai-nilai serta\n"
"perilaku kontributor dan peserta dalam komunitas open source Qiskit.\n"
"Kode Etik berlaku baik di dalam ruang proyek maupun di ruang publik\n"
"ketika seseorang berinteraksi dengan komunitas open source Qiskit. Contohnya\n"
"termasuk menghadiri acara Qiskit, berkontribusi pada proyek online, komentar\n"
"di Slack, atau mewakili proyek atau komunitas, termasuk menggunakan alamat\n"
"e-mail resmi proyek, memposting melalui akun media sosial resmi, atau\n"
"bertindak sebagai perwakilan yang ditunjuk di acara online atau offline.\n"
"Representasi suatu proyek dapat didefinisikan lebih lanjut dan diperjelas oleh\n"
"pemelihara proyek.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our Standards {#our-standards}"
msgstr "Standar Kami {#our-standards}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Examples of behavior that contributes to creating a positive environment\n"
"include:\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh perilaku yang berkontribusi pada terciptanya lingkungan yang positif\n"
"meliputi:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using welcoming and inclusive language\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan bahasa yang ramah dan inklusif\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Being respectful of differing viewpoints, experiences, and cultures\n"
msgstr "Menghormati sudut pandang, pengalaman, dan budaya yang berbeda\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gracefully accepting constructive criticism\n"
msgstr "Menerima kritik konstruktif dengan lapang dada\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Focusing on what is best for the community\n"
msgstr "Fokus pada apa yang terbaik bagi komunitas\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Showing empathy towards other community members\n"
msgstr "Menunjukkan empati terhadap anggota komunitas lain\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Being mindful of your surroundings and your fellow participants and listening\n"
"to others\n"
msgstr ""
"Memperhatikan lingkungan sekitar dan sesama peserta serta mendengarkan\n"
"orang lain\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Valuing the contributions of all participants\n"
msgstr "Menghargai kontribusi semua peserta\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Engaging in collaboration before conflict\n"
msgstr "Mengutamakan kolaborasi sebelum konflik\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Pointing out unintentionally racist, sexist, casteist, or biased comments and\n"
"jokes made by community members when they happen\n"
msgstr "Menyoroti komentar dan lelucon yang secara tidak sengaja bersifat rasis, seksis, kasteis, atau bias yang dibuat oleh anggota komunitas ketika hal itu terjadi\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Examples of unacceptable behavior by participants, even when presented as\n"
"\"ironic\" or \"joking,\" include:\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh perilaku yang tidak dapat diterima oleh peserta, bahkan ketika disajikan sebagai\n"
"\"ironi\" atau \"candaan,\" meliputi:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The use of sexualized language or imagery and unwelcome physical contact,\n"
"sexual attention, or advances\n"
msgstr ""
"Penggunaan bahasa atau gambar yang bersifat seksual dan kontak fisik yang tidak diinginkan,\n"
"perhatian seksual, atau tindakan menggoda\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trolling, insulting/derogatory comments, and personal or political attacks\n"
msgstr "Trolling, komentar menghina/merendahkan, serta serangan pribadi atau politik\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public or private harassment, including offensive or degrading language\n"
msgstr "Pelecehan publik atau pribadi, termasuk bahasa yang ofensif atau merendahkan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Publishing others' private information, such as a physical or electronic\n"
"address, without explicit permission. This includes any sort of \"outing\" of\n"
"any aspect of someone's identity without their consent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mempublikasikan informasi pribadi orang lain, seperti alamat fisik atau elektronik,\n"
"tanpa izin eksplisit. Ini termasuk segala bentuk \"outing\" atas\n"
"aspek apapun dari identitas seseorang tanpa persetujuan mereka.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\"Doxxing,\" Publishing screenshots or quotes, especially from identity slack\n"
"channels, private chat, or public events, without all quoted users' explicit\n"
"consent.\n"
msgstr ""
"\"Doxxing,\" mempublikasikan tangkapan layar atau kutipan, terutama dari channel slack\n"
"identitas, obrolan pribadi, atau acara publik, tanpa persetujuan eksplisit semua pengguna yang dikutip.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Engaging in spamming activities, such as repeatedly sending unsolicited messages, LLMs (Large Language Models) output, advertisements, or promotional content to community members without previous IBM authorization.\n"
msgstr "Terlibat dalam aktivitas spam, seperti berulang kali mengirim pesan yang tidak diminta, output LLM (Large Language Models), iklan, atau konten promosi kepada anggota komunitas tanpa otorisasi IBM sebelumnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Other conduct which could reasonably be considered inappropriate in a\n"
"professional setting\n"
msgstr ""
"Perilaku lain yang secara wajar dapat dianggap tidak pantas dalam\n"
"lingkungan profesional\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"responsibilities-enforcement\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"responsibilities-enforcement\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Responsibilities and enforcement {#responsibilities-and-enforcement}"
msgstr "Tanggung Jawab dan Penegakan {#responsibilities-and-enforcement}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The entire Qiskit community is responsible for upholding the terms of the Code\n"
"of Conduct in Qiskit Community events and spaces and reporting violations if\n"
"they see them. The internal Qiskit team at IBM is ultimately responsible for\n"
"clarifying the standards of acceptable behavior and enforcement, and is expected\n"
"to take appropriate and fair corrective action in response to any instances of\n"
"unacceptable behavior.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seluruh komunitas Qiskit bertanggung jawab untuk menegakkan ketentuan Kode\n"
"Etik di acara dan ruang Komunitas Qiskit serta melaporkan pelanggaran jika\n"
"mereka melihatnya. Tim Qiskit internal di IBM pada akhirnya bertanggung jawab untuk\n"
"mengklarifikasi standar perilaku yang dapat diterima dan penegakannya, dan diharapkan\n"
"untuk mengambil tindakan korektif yang tepat dan adil sebagai respons atas setiap pelanggaran\n"
"perilaku yang tidak dapat diterima.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If a participant or contributor engages in negative or harmful behavior, IBM\n"
"will take any action they deem appropriate, including but not limited to\n"
"issuing warnings, expulsion from an event with no refund, deleting comments,\n"
"permanent banning from future events or online community, or calling local law\n"
"enforcement. IBM has the right and responsibility to remove, edit, or reject\n"
"comments, commits, code, wiki edits, issues, and other contributions that are\n"
"not aligned to this Code of Conduct, or to temporarily or permanently ban any\n"
"contributor or participant for other behaviors that they deem inappropriate,\n"
"threatening, offensive, or harmful.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika seorang peserta atau kontributor terlibat dalam perilaku negatif atau berbahaya, IBM\n"
"akan mengambil tindakan yang dianggap sesuai, termasuk namun tidak terbatas pada\n"
"memberikan peringatan, pengusiran dari acara tanpa pengembalian dana, menghapus komentar,\n"
"pemblokiran permanen dari acara mendatang atau komunitas online, atau memanggil penegak hukum setempat. IBM memiliki hak dan tanggung jawab untuk menghapus, mengedit, atau menolak\n"
"komentar, commit, kode, pengeditan wiki, isu, dan kontribusi lainnya yang tidak\n"
"selaras dengan Kode Etik ini, atau untuk melarang sementara atau permanen kontributor\n"
"atau peserta mana pun atas perilaku lain yang dianggap tidak pantas,\n"
"mengancam, ofensif, atau berbahaya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you see a Code of Conduct violation:\n"
msgstr "Jika Anda melihat pelanggaran Kode Etik:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you feel comfortable, let the person know that what they did is not\n"
"appropriate and ask them to stop and/or edit or delete their message(s) or\n"
"comment(s).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda merasa nyaman, beri tahu orang tersebut bahwa apa yang mereka lakukan tidak\n"
"pantas dan minta mereka untuk berhenti dan/atau mengedit atau menghapus pesan atau\n"
"komentar mereka.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the person does not immediately stop the behavior or correct the issue,\n"
"or if you're uncomfortable speaking up, flag a moderator and, if appropriate,\n"
"fill out the anonymous\n"
"[Code of Conduct violation form](https://airtable.com/shrl5mEF4Eun1aIDm).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika orang tersebut tidak segera menghentikan perilakunya atau memperbaiki masalah,\n"
"atau jika Anda tidak nyaman berbicara, tandai moderator dan, jika sesuai,\n"
"isi formulir pelanggaran anonim\n"
"[Code of Conduct violation form](https://airtable.com/shrl5mEF4Eun1aIDm).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit Community will open an investigation upon receiving your form\n"
"entry. When reporting, please include any relevant details, links,\n"
"screenshots, context, or other information that may be used to better\n"
"understand and resolve the situation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Komunitas Qiskit akan membuka penyelidikan setelah menerima entri formulir Anda. Saat melapor, harap sertakan detail relevan, tautan,\n"
"tangkapan layar, konteks, atau informasi lain yang dapat digunakan untuk lebih\n"
"memahami dan menyelesaikan situasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the code of conduct violation occurs at an event and requires immediate\n"
"response or contains a concern about an individual attending an upcoming\n"
"event, contact the event's on-call Code of Conduct point of contact listed\n"
"in the event specific code of conduct document. If you don't feel comfortable\n"
"speaking to the point of contact in person, fill out a Code of Conduct\n"
"violation form entry and include the details of the event so that the Code of\n"
"Conduct enforcement board can contact the event's on-call Code of Conduct\n"
"point of contact.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika pelanggaran kode etik terjadi di suatu acara dan memerlukan respons segera\n"
"atau mengandung kekhawatiran tentang seseorang yang akan menghadiri acara mendatang,\n"
"hubungi kontak Kode Etik on-call acara tersebut yang tercantum\n"
"dalam dokumen kode etik khusus acara. Jika Anda tidak merasa nyaman\n"
"berbicara dengan kontak tersebut secara langsung, isi entri formulir pelanggaran Kode Etik\n"
"dan sertakan detail acara agar dewan penegakan Kode Etik dapat menghubungi kontak Kode Etik on-call acara.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If an IBM employee witnesses a Code of Conduct violation at any time, such as\n"
"at events, in a Slack channel, or open source forums, it is their\n"
"responsibility to file a Code of Conduct violation report.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika karyawan IBM menyaksikan pelanggaran Kode Etik kapan saja, seperti\n"
"di acara, di channel Slack, atau forum open source, maka itu adalah\n"
"tanggung jawab mereka untuk mengajukan laporan pelanggaran Kode Etik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This Code of Conduct does not supersede existing IBM corporate policies, such as\n"
"the IBM Business Conduct Guidelines and IBM Business Partner Code of Conduct.\n"
"IBM employees must follow the IBM Business Conduct Guidelines. IBM business\n"
"partners must follow the IBM Business Partner Code of Conduct. IBM employees\n"
"concerned with a fellow IBMer's behavior should follow IBM's own internal HR\n"
"reporting protocols, which include engaging the offending IBMer's manager and\n"
"involving IBM Concerns and Appeals. IBM employees concerned with an IBM\n"
"business partner's behavior should notify tellibm@us.ibm.com.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode Etik ini tidak menggantikan kebijakan perusahaan IBM yang ada, seperti\n"
"Pedoman Perilaku Bisnis IBM dan Kode Etik Mitra Bisnis IBM.\n"
"Karyawan IBM harus mengikuti Pedoman Perilaku Bisnis IBM. Mitra bisnis IBM\n"
"harus mengikuti Kode Etik Mitra Bisnis IBM. Karyawan IBM yang\n"
"khawatir dengan perilaku sesama karyawan IBM harus mengikuti protokol\n"
"pelaporan HR internal IBM, yang mencakup melibatkan manajer karyawan IBM yang melanggar dan\n"
"melibatkan IBM Concerns and Appeals. Karyawan IBM yang khawatir dengan perilaku\n"
"mitra bisnis IBM harus menghubungi tellibm@us.ibm.com.\n"
